# VOXI Project Architecture

> [!info] Living document — updated as the system evolves

## System Overview

The VOXI platform converts natural language into spatial representations
through a three-tier pipeline:

~~~graph directed
[User Prompt] --> [Brain Converter]
[Brain Converter] --> [VOXI DSL]
[VOXI DSL] --> [3D Renderer]
[VOXI DSL] --> [2D Renderer]
[Brain Converter] --> [Depth Estimator]
[Depth Estimator] --> [VOXI DSL]
colors = #6c8cff #43a047 #e53935 #fdd835
~~~

## Token Efficiency

One of VOXI's key advantages: describing a 3D scene in ~100 tokens
vs thousands for mesh formats.

~~~chart bar
"Tokens per Scene" = OBJ:2400 STL:3200 GLTF:1800 VOXI:95
colors = #8888a0 #8888a0 #8888a0 #6c8cff
~~~

The difference is dramatic. VOXI achieves this through:

1. **Single-letter commands** — `B` for box, `S` for sphere
2. **Hex color shorthand** — 16 palette colors via `0-f`
3. **Implicit defaults** — volume size auto-inferred

## Module Breakdown

### Brain Converter

Handles NL → VOXI translation with Claude.

~~~voxi
CANVAS 500 160 #0f1117
RECT 10 10 140 60 1 #1a3a6b 6
TEXT 30 32 "Prompt" 14 2 #6c8cff bold
TEXT 30 52 "\"a penguin\"" 10 2 #8888a0

LINE 150 40 200 40 2 #6c8cff 2
TEXT 158 28 "Claude" 9 3 #43a047

RECT 200 10 160 60 1 #2e7d32 6
TEXT 220 32 "Brain Conv." 14 2 #43a047 bold
TEXT 220 52 "NL → DSL" 10 2 #8888a0

LINE 360 40 400 40 2 #6c8cff 2

RECT 400 10 90 60 1 #8d6e4a 6
TEXT 415 32 ".voxi" 14 2 #ff9800 bold
TEXT 410 52 "~100 tok" 10 2 #8888a0

RECT 10 90 480 60 1 #1a1d27 4
TEXT 20 106 "Pipeline: prompt → system prompt → Claude API → parse → validate → .voxi" 10 2 #8888a0
~~~

### Renderer Stack

~~~voxi
CANVAS 500 100 #0f1117
RECT 10 10 100 80 1 #e53935 6
TEXT 25 38 "Parser" 13 2 #fff bold
TEXT 20 58 "tokenize" 9 2 #ffcdd2

RECT 130 10 100 80 1 #ff9800 6
TEXT 140 38 "Voxelize" 13 2 #fff bold
TEXT 135 58 "fill volume" 9 2 #ffe0b2

RECT 250 10 110 80 1 #1e88e5 6
TEXT 260 38 "Raycast" 13 2 #fff bold
TEXT 255 58 "pixel buffer" 9 2 #bbdefb

RECT 380 10 110 80 1 #43a047 6
TEXT 395 38 "Shade" 13 2 #fff bold
TEXT 385 58 "depth+light" 9 2 #c8e6c9

LINE 110 50 130 50 2 #8888a0 2
LINE 230 50 250 50 2 #8888a0 2
LINE 360 50 380 50 2 #8888a0 2
~~~

## Benchmark Results

Latest spatial reasoning accuracy (March 2026):

~~~chart bar
"Accuracy %" = VOXI:87 Text-only:34 Image:72 Depth-map:51
colors = #6c8cff #e53935 #43a047 #ff9800
~~~

## Sample Output

A castle scene generated from the prompt *"a castle on a green hill"*:

~~~voxi3d 35 25
V 32 32 32
-- Green hill
K 16 0 16 14 10 2
B 2 0 2 28 2 28 2
-- Castle base
B 11 10 11 10 8 10 9
-- Towers
B 10 10 10 3 14 3 9
B 19 10 10 3 14 3 9
B 10 10 19 3 14 3 9
B 19 10 19 3 14 3 9
-- Tower tops (red)
K 11 24 11 2 3 1
K 20 24 11 2 3 1
K 11 24 20 2 3 1
K 20 24 20 2 3 1
-- Gate
B 14 10 10 4 5 1 0
B 15 10 10 2 6 1 0
-- Walls top crenellations
B 11 18 11 2 1 10 9
B 13 18 11 1 2 10 9
B 15 18 11 2 1 10 9
B 17 18 11 1 2 10 9
B 19 18 11 2 1 10 9
~~~

